 "description": "Macro mode for the Digitakt II: hold PAGE and press MOD (or the other way round) and encoders A-H become eight macros, each moving up to four parameters on the tracks you choose. FUNC + an encoder push opens its setup. The configuration is kept on the card (docs/findings/s5-storage.md).",
